## 16. Further Information

You may request further information about the way we manage your personal or credit-related information by telephoning us on 1300 329 037 or by writing to us at [privacy@moneyme.com.au](mailto:privacy@moneyme.com.au).

## 16. Variations to the Privacy Policy

We reserve the right to modify this Privacy Policy at any time by publishing an updated version of this Privacy Policy on our Website and taking any further action as required by law, and the updated version will apply from the date it is published. We will tell you about significant changes by notice on our Website or by contacting you directly.

You may request this policy in an alternative form by telephoning us on 1300 669 059 or by writing to us at [privacy@moneyme.com.au](mailto:privacy@moneyme.com.au).

